  "docs": {
    "expr": "Direct left recursion folded at compile time: `*` binds tighter\nthan `+`, both left-associative (the ANTLR 4 rewrite, C9)."
  },
  "source": "## Semantics: C9, C2, C3, C7, K1, A1, A4, M0\ngrammar ConformanceLeftRecArith version \"1.0.0\" mode \"v1\" {\n  ## Direct left recursion folded at compile time: `*` binds tighter\n  ## than `+`, both left-associative (the ANTLR 4 rewrite, C9).\n  expr = expr ( \"*\" expr ) as mul / expr ( \"+\" expr ) as add / term\n  term = ( 1*%x30-39 ) as num\n  top = ( expr ) as expr\n\n  entry top: top\n\n  test top {\n    shape \"1+2*3\" { expr: [ { num: \"1\" },\n      { add: [ { num: \"2\" }, { mul: { num: \"3\" } } ] } ] }\n    shape \"1*2+3\" { expr: [ { num: \"1\" },\n      { mul: { num: \"2\" } }, { add: { num: \"3\" } } ] }\n    shape \"1+2+3\" { expr: [ { num: \"1\" },\n      { add: { num: \"2\" } }, { add: { num: \"3\" } } ] }\n    shape \"1*2*3\" { expr: [ { num: \"1\" },\n      { mul: { num: \"2\" } }, { mul: { num: \"3\" } } ] }\n    reject \"+1\"\n    reject \"1+\"\n  }\n}\n",
